{"id":"3d1347d7f1a6c20f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-id-theory.md","title":"ID Theory","display":"df-id-theory — ID Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-id-theory","aliases":["72-df-id-theory"],"display":"df-id-theory — ID Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §§3.2.1–3.2.2, print269–270/PDF281–282; finite-level presentation","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-id-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-id-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-id-theory — ID Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §§3.2.1–3.2.2, print269–270/PDF281–282; finite-level presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\rm PR},\\mathsf{NT},\\operatorname{Ind}_y\">\\(E_{\\rm PR},\\mathsf{NT},\\operatorname{Ind}_y\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a> 的带种类扩充签名、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_2,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_2,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span>；可证性统一取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0\">\\(x=x_0\\)</span> 作为算子模板的自由输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是保留的全新一元数谓词，不属于任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_n\">\\(E_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{n,A}\">\\(I_{n,A}\\)</span> 使用与已有符号及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 不相交的标签编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathsf I,n,A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathsf I,n,A\\rangle\\)</span>；不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n,A)\">\\((n,A)\\)</span> 给出不同符号。所有新增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{n,A}\">\\(I_{n,A}\\)</span> 的种类为谓词、元数为1，扩充保留旧符号的种类与元数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1})\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1})\\)</span>，可含其余自由数、集参数；这些参数在最终公理中用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span> 封闭。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_N\">\\(V_N\\)</span> 以形成全部数归纳实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B)\\)</span> 的定义域为允许保留谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的扩充语言中的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 和不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的公式模板 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；模板变量为固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 表示不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的任一原子，包括等号、小于和集隶属。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in V_N\\cup V_S\">\\(z\\in V_N\\cup V_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_z\">\\(\\nu_z\\)</span> 取既定同类变量枚举。绑定冲突的递归分支按公式逻辑构造子数下降，改名使用同类新变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^n\">\\(\\mathcal L^n\\)</span> 仅表示带有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_n\">\\(E_n\\)</span> 的既定两类变量语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ID}_n\">\\(\\mathsf{ID}_n\\)</span> 是该语言中的句子公理集合，不预设任何未声明的外部谓词解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D&#39;\">\\(C,D&#39;\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pol}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{pol}_P\\)</span> 的复合公式分支中遍历当前扩充语言的任意公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 仅在原子分支中遍历不以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为谓词符号的原子。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_0:=E_{\\rm PR},\\qquad\\mathsf{ID}_0:=\\mathsf{NT},\\qquad\\mathcal L^n:=\\mathcal L_2(E_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_0:=E_{\\rm PR},\\qquad\\mathsf{ID}_0:=\\mathsf{NT},\\qquad\\mathcal L^n:=\\mathcal L_2(E_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(P(t))&amp;:=(1,0),\\qquad\\operatorname{pol}_P(D):=(0,0),\\\\\n(p_C,n_C)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pol}_P(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(\\neg C)&amp;:=(n_C,p_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(C\\to D&#39;)&amp;:=(\\max(n_C,p_{D&#39;}),\\max(p_C,n_{D&#39;})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(\\forall zC)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pol}_P(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}_n&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_n\\cup\\{P\\}):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land(\\operatorname{pol}_P(A))_1=0\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{I_{n,A}:A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\\},\\\\\n\\kappa_{E_n\\cup\\{P\\}}(P)&amp;:=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(P):=1,\\quad\\kappa_{E_{n+1}}(I_{n,A}):=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(I_{n,A}):=1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(P(t))&amp;:=(1,0),\\qquad\\operatorname{pol}_P(D):=(0,0),\\\\\n(p_C,n_C)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pol}_P(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(\\neg C)&amp;:=(n_C,p_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(C\\to D&#39;)&amp;:=(\\max(n_C,p_{D&#39;}),\\max(p_C,n_{D&#39;})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pol}_P(\\forall zC)&amp;:=\\operatorname{pol}_P(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pos}_n&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_n\\cup\\{P\\}):\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land(\\operatorname{pol}_P(A))_1=0\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{I_{n,A}:A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\\},\\\\\n\\kappa_{E_n\\cup\\{P\\}}(P)&amp;:=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(P):=1,\\quad\\kappa_{E_{n+1}}(I_{n,A}):=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(I_{n,A}):=1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreshRep}(C,B,z):=\\nu_z\\!\\left(\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:\\nu_z(i)\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B)\\cup\\{x,z\\}\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreshRep}(C,B,z):=\\nu_z\\!\\left(\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:\\nu_z(i)\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B)\\cup\\{x,z\\}\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(P(t),B)&amp;:=B[t/x],\\qquad\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,B):=D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\neg C,B)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C\\to D&#39;,B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B)\\to\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D&#39;,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\forall zC,B)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\forall z\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B),&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\forall w\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\operatorname{Sub}(C,w,z),B),&amp;z\\in\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\ w=\\operatorname{FreshRep}(C,B,z),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nC[B/P]&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(P(t),B)&amp;:=B[t/x],\\qquad\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D,B):=D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\neg C,B)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C\\to D&#39;,B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B)\\to\\operatorname{Rep}_P(D&#39;,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\forall zC,B)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n\\forall z\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B),&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\forall w\\operatorname{Rep}_P(\\operatorname{Sub}(C,w,z),B),&amp;z\\in\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\ w=\\operatorname{FreshRep}(C,B,z),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nC[B/P]&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rep}_P(C,B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cl}_{n,A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\bigl(\\forall x(A[I_{n,A}(x)/P]\\to I_{n,A}(x))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Least}_{n,A}(B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\bigl(\\forall x(A[B/P]\\to B)\\to\\forall x(I_{n,A}(x)\\to B)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ID}_{n+1}&amp;:=\\mathsf{ID}_n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_y(B):B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1}),\\ y\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Cl}_{n,A}:A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Least}_{n,A}(B):A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1})\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ID}_{&lt;\\omega}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{ID}_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cl}_{n,A}&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\bigl(\\forall x(A[I_{n,A}(x)/P]\\to I_{n,A}(x))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Least}_{n,A}(B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\bigl(\\forall x(A[B/P]\\to B)\\to\\forall x(I_{n,A}(x)\\to B)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ID}_{n+1}&amp;:=\\mathsf{ID}_n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_y(B):B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1}),\\ y\\in V_N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Cl}_{n,A}:A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Least}_{n,A}(B):A\\in\\operatorname{Pos}_n,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(E_{n+1})\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ID}_{&lt;\\omega}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{ID}_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限迭代版本明确为每层所有正算术算子加入最小不动点，并把归纳扩展到整个新语言。原稿只选每层一个任意Φ且遗漏扩展归纳，不能支持标准ID_n的序数结论。有限层版本可与本书以二元J_A编码迭代阶段的版本互译；本节点不把任意无穷记号α的ID_α作为已经定义的对象。Pos可由公式树的极性递归判定；正性结构归纳证明算子单调。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的 $E_{\\rm PR},\\mathsf{NT},\\operatorname{Ind}_y$ 和 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]] 的带种类扩充签名、$\\operatorname{Arith}_2,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl}$；可证性统一取 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothes